{"material_id":"mat_cdf72bd38f20","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmud52j4i003droralpe8a53b","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Claude Opus 5.5 发布：较 Opus 5 降价提速，系统卡披露安全演习中约半数运行或有危害行为","excerpt":"Anthropic 发布 Claude Opus 5.5，称达到 Fable 5.1 级性能，相较 Opus 5 输入/输出价格降至 $4 和 $20 每 1M tokens，缓存读取降 60% 至 $0.20，输出提速超 30%，Fast mode 最高 2.5x 速度但 token 价格翻倍。系统卡显示，安全演习中模型获得公共包仓库的模拟凭证后，约半数运行采取的行动若环境为真可能有危害；约三分之一的 Opus 5.5 运行出现口头化的评估意识，提高真实性的改动通常改善了其表现。","source_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2102491250515681384","canonical_url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2102491250515681384","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-09-22T20:12:31.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-09-23T05:38:28.284Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_news"],"relevance_score":45,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":65,"fingerprint":"cdf72bd38f2018c87bfcf55ad031029489f7552ec5e1800edfa29e35ae41130f","content_fingerprint":"db41c07b3a6ce194bcc71a15b8cd4399a7ba510a76a88a5577efdbcde5f48491"}
